HTML boiler plate is a standard set of code that is created at the start of every project

<!DOCTYPE HTML>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <title>My Website</title>
    </head>

    <body>
        <h1>Hello World!</h1>
    </body>
</html>

<ul></ul> unordered list
<ol></ol> ordered list
<li></li> list item

There are specific attributes which are related to certain tags and global attributes that can be used on any tags.

<img src="img url" alt="description"> to create images